function suF(s){fm(s?'Edit supplier':'Add supplier',[['n','Business name','text','w'],['c','Contact person','text'],['p','Phone','text'],['e','Email','email','w'],['a','Address','text','w'],['s','Products supplied','text','w']],s?[s.name,s.contact,s.phone,s.email,s.addr,s.sup]:['','','+250 7','','',''],r=>{if(s){Object.assign(s,{name:r[0],contact:r[1],phone:r[2],email:r[3],addr:r[4],sup:r[5]});toast('Supplier updated')}else{S.sp.unshift({id:++S.sid,name:r[0].trim(),contact:r[1],phone:r[2],email:r[3],addr:r[4],sup:r[5],bal:0});toast('Supplier added')}})}
